  "instructions": [
    "In a bowl whisk together olive oil, honey, soy sauce, lemon juice, minced garlic, dill, salt, and pepper to create the glaze.",
    "Pat the chicken thighs dry, then coat them thoroughly with the glaze, letting them marinate for 15 minutes at room temperature.",
    "Preheat a robata grill or grill pan to medium‑high heat until it reaches 205°C (400°F).",
    "Place the marinated chicken on the grill, cooking for 5–6 minutes per side or until the internal temperature reaches 75°C (165°F).",
    "Remove from the grill and let the chicken rest for 3 minutes before slicing.",
    "Serve immediately with a side of fresh arugula or mixed greens if desired."
  ],
